k access to underfloor cabling and wiring. It is lightweight, easy to grip, and provides secure suction for lifting standard-size panels.</p><p><br></p><p>For heavier or larger raised floor tiles, the Double Cup Lifter offers twice the suction power and enhanced stability. Its dual rubber cups generate strong grip force, making it ideal for technical rooms and professional raised floor installation teams.</p><p><br></p><p>Built with non-marking rubber cups and ergonomic handles, both models offer superior control while minimizing hand fatigue during frequent use. Whether you're installing new floors or accessing underfloor systems, the Raised Floor Panel Cup Lifter delivers reliability, safety, and convenience — making it a must-have tool for any raised floor infrastructure.</p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/atflor-cement-core-raised-floor-panel\">ATFLOR Cement Core Raised Floor Panel</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"pri